			aBIErrorCollection["27L"] = new MessageError(errorCode: "27L", shortDesc: "*CENSUS* QTY1/QTY2 (TARIFF 3)", narrative: "THIS IS AN ABI REPLY TO AN ENTRY SUMMARY INPUT TRANSACTION. IT INDICATES THAT THE RATIO OF THE FIRST QUANTITY ON A LINE TO THE SECOND QUANTITY, FOR THE THIRD OF THREE TARIFF NUMBERS REPORTED FOR THE LINE, IS OUTSIDE THE RANGE ESTABLISHED BY CENSUS FROM PREVIOUSLY REPORTED IMPORTATIONS. IF THE FILER REVIEWS ITS DATA AND DETERMINES THAT THE QUANTITIES AND TARIFF NUMBER BEING REPORTED ARE CORRECT, NO FURTHER TRANSMISSIONS TO ABI ARE REQUIRED, BUT THE FILER SHOULD ALERT THE LOCAL ENTRY TEAM TO THIS DATA.");
