			aBIErrorCollection["VA2"] = new MessageError(errorCode: "VA2", shortDesc: "UNKNOWN AGY IN 'OA' DECLARATION", narrative: "THE OA DECLARATION IS A RECORD IN AN OTHER GOVERNMENT AGENCY DATA SET IN AN AUTOMATED TRANSACTION. IT IS THE RECORD WHERE A FILER CAN 'DISCLAIM' A TARIFF NUMBER FROM OGA DATA. AS OF 5/99 THE PERMITTED OTHER AGENCIES ARE FDA (FD0), FWS (FW0), DOT (DT0) AND FCC (FC0). IN AN ENTRY SUMMARY TRANSACTION (EI) THE OA RECORD FOLLOWS THE 50 RECORD. IN A CARGO SELECTIVITY TRANSACTION (HI) THE OA RECORD FOLLOWS THE H5 RECORD (FDA, FWS AND DOT). IN A BORDER CARGO SELECTIVITY TRANSACTION (HN) THE OA RECORD FOLLOWS THE 02 RECORD (FDA, FWS, DOT). THE OGA DISCLAIMER IS SENT IN POSITIONS 5-7 OF THE OA RECORD. SUBSEQUENT DISCLAIMERS ARE SENT IN POSITIONS 8-10, 11-13, 14-16 AND 17-19, WHEN APPLICABLE. THIS ERROR MESSAGE WILL OCCUR IF THE OTHER AGENCY SENT IN POSITIONS 5-6 (OR 8-9, 11-12, 14-15, 17-18) IS NOT A VALID OGA INTERFACE AGENCY. SEE QUERY OGAL TO CHECK FOR VALIDITY. ANOTHER CAUSE WAS FOUND IN MAY 1999. IN THE ABCT SCREEN THE OA RECORD SHOWED SPACES EXCEPT IN POSITIONS 1-2 AND 5-7. HOWEVER, WHEN THE ABCL SCREEN WAS BROUGHT UP, THE CURSOR PUT ON THE OA RECORD AND PF1 ENTERED, THE OA RECORD SHOWED OTHER THAN SPACES IN POSITION 8-19 WHICH CAUSED THIS REJECT.");
			aBIErrorCollection["VA3"] = new MessageError(errorCode: "VA3", shortDesc: "FORM REC TYPE INV/OUT OF SEQ", narrative: "THIS MESSAGE OCCURS IN A FDA INTERFACE ENTRY. THE REQUIRED ORDER OF FDA LINES IS;  FD01  FD02  FD03  FD04 (OPTIONAL)  FD05 (OPTIONAL)  IF ONE OF THE RECORDS IS OMITTED (E.G. FD01 THEN FD03) THIS MESSAGE WILL OCCUR.  IF THE ENTRY INVOLVES DOT REPORTING, THE SEQUENCE MUST BE: DT01, THEN DT02 IF THE FILER TRANSMITS AN 'HI' INPUT. DT01/DT03 IS ACCEPTABLE IN AN 'EI' INPUT, HOWEVER.");
			aBIErrorCollection["VA6"] = new MessageError(errorCode: "VA6", shortDesc: "OGA OI REC MAY NOT BE BLANK", narrative: "THE 'OI' RECORD IS USED IN OTHER GOVERNMENT AGENCY ENTRIES. THE DESCRIPTION IS LOCATED IN THE CATAIR, PAGE OG-11. THIS RECORD IS SENT WHEN THERE IS DATA TO BE SENT (I.E. THE LINE IS NOT 'DISCLAIMED'). IF SENT, THE RECORD MUST NOT BE BLANK. THERE MUST BE A COMMERCIAL DESCRIPTION SENT (POS 11-80). THE TARIFF DESCRIPTION IS NOT TO BE SENT.");
			aBIErrorCollection["VA7"] = new MessageError(errorCode: "VA7", shortDesc: "TARIFF REQUIRES OGA INFO", narrative: "IF THE TARIFF NUMBER HAS AN FD1 IN THE HSA FILE, THE FILER MUST TRANSMIT EITHER AN OA DISCLAIMER RECORD OR THE APPLICABLE FWS INFORMATION IN THE OI, FD01, FD02 AND FD03 RECORDS. IF THE TARIFF NUMBER HAS AN FD2 IN THE HSA FILE, THE FILER MUST TRANSMIT THE OI, FD01, FD02 AND FD03 RECORDS.  WITH BTA THE FDA INDICATORS HAVE EXPANDED TO INCLUDE FD3 AND FD4. THE FD04 AND FD05 RECORDS MAY ALSO BE REQUIRED.");
			aBIErrorCollection["VAA"] = new MessageError(errorCode: "VAA", shortDesc: "FC 740: INV IMPORT CONDTN NBR", narrative: "THE IMPORT CONDITION NUMBER IS SENT IN THE FC01 RECORD, POSITIONS 5-6. A CODE OF 01 - 08 IS SENT IDENTIFYING THE FCC IMPORT CONDITION. ANY OTHER CODES WILL BE REJECTED. SEE PAGE OGA-25, CATAIR.");
